{"name": "Husk Protocol", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"236\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/bdab8daffe1e9018f6c3b3381dbabac4.avif?t=1787647141\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aeterna was the ultimate city and the eventual endpoint of human-machine coexistence. A self-sustained, self-sufficient ecosystem built to thrive amid the barren wastes of the fallen world, a monument to humanity's final hope. Its design approached perfection, yet ethical concerns demanded a safeguard: a human consciousness digitized and merged with the AI to provide the \"human touch\" the people feared losing. One fragile thread keeping the balance intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/d8989b539f58443ffe07b4674fb9f2eb.poster.avif?t=1787647141\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/d8989b539f58443ffe07b4674fb9f2eb.webm?t=1787647141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/d8989b539f58443ffe07b4674fb9f2eb.mp4?t=1787647141\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"236\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/7186c20cb70d815a84d3c339218a2898.avif?t=1787647141\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restore Aeterna\u2019s humanity through the Husk Protocol, allowing the last remnants of human consciousness to override the city\u2019s mechanical workforce and use them to reach its corrupted core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Husks are powerful, with their own decks, playstyles and relics. However, damage is permanent. Not only must you take advantage of each Husk\u2019s strength as you battle your way through each biome, you must also engage in Husk Switching - a powerful tool that allows you to jump between Husks when one is near destruction in order to survive, allowing for a range of different strategies.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/d018a206b664a3e90950f03961716005.poster.avif?t=1787647141\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/d018a206b664a3e90950f03961716005.webm?t=1787647141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/d018a206b664a3e90950f03961716005.mp4?t=1787647141\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"236\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/89bece84d6d08977e3eba1b04450c08d.avif?t=1787647141\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are being hunted by the city\u2019s mainframe as you traverse between each node through 3 biomes. Initiate Husk Switching or Hack the city\u2019s Countermeasures during battle for powerful rewards and to delay detection. If the detection meter hits 0, the Guardian of the biome will begin looking for you and a boss battle may commence early, so be prepared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each loss, you grow stronger, unlocking more husks, cards and modules with each run of this first-person roguelite deckbuilder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/764acbd3628e6f582a6c36b9aea02250.poster.avif?t=1787647141\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/764acbd3628e6f582a6c36b9aea02250.webm?t=1787647141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/764acbd3628e6f582a6c36b9aea02250.mp4?t=1787647141\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"236\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/3363d4155e3403cd1b44f34c7a99583e.avif?t=1787647141\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 powerful Husks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">300+ Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">70+ Modules to modify your build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ Story Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 unique Bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/0a40585ac6f4460ecbba78b588f06ba0.poster.avif?t=1787647141\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/0a40585ac6f4460ecbba78b588f06ba0.webm?t=1787647141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/extras/0a40585ac6f4460ecbba78b588f06ba0.mp4?t=1787647141\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "ATTENTION! HUSK PROTOCOL INITIATED! Prepare to engage in a challenging deck-driven mecha game. Synergise between powerful Husks, utilise a dynamic deck and avoid detection from the city\u2019s mainframe as you infiltrate the machine-driven brutopolis of Aeterna.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202270/760b2d6e925ef694e1db85d3db3b6b076f3c4c20/header.jpg?t=1787647141", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Strategy", "Deckbuilding", "Card Game", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Turn-Based Combat"], "developers": "OddSub", "publishers": "OddSub", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4202270", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 April 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/6DS8mEhvBQ4", "first_seen": 1776895200.0, "review_rank": 821}